(b) sublicense or sell the covered files; or

(c) use the covered files to build a different product.

You may redistribute Anvil Browser without the engine source. The engine
source is shared for auditing and use only.

The names "Anvil" and "Anvil Browser" are not licensed for use on any
other product.

